cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on NeoCRM, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NeoCRM: agent-native relationship management"
abstract: >-
  NeoCRM is an experiment in agent-native customer relationship management.
  It explores how people and governed specialist agents can understand and
  manage unified relationships across sales, service, marketing and
  cross-functional work without making one vendor schema the product.
  NeoCRM owns the semantic model, not the storage model.
